  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: Wild appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols except
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: 3 Scatters on reels 3, 4 and 5 triggers <color=#ff06a6>Supreme Eagle Free
      Games.</color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '-             ,            ,            and               symbols on reel
      6 appears with Cash Prize or Jackpot.

      - One or more 6 of a kind wins including 1x2 High Symbol on reel 6 awards the
      reward written on the symbol on reel 6.

      - Reward is awarded only once per spin.

      - If a player is not eligible for the Jackpot of 1x2 High Symbol on reel 6,
      then award the highest Jackpot available to that player.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- During any reel spins, Eagle Surprise Feature is randomly triggered.\n-
      During Eagle Surprise Feature, Eagle Wild appears on reels 1 and 2 and one of
      the followings is randomly triggered:\n     - Random Wilds appear on reels 3,
      4 and 5.\n     - One of the High symbols are spread onto the reels 3, 4 and
      5."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: '- 3 Scatters on reels 3, 4 and 5 trigger Supreme Eagle Free Games.

      - During Supreme Eagle Free Games, <color=#ff06a6>EAGLE SURPRISE FEATURE</color>
      may occur more often.

      - 3 Scatters on reels 3, 4 and 5 re-triggers Supreme Eagle Free Games.'
